00:10:55.730 --> 00:11:01.070
All we're doing here is we're
subscribing to a Pub/Sub topic,

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:05.570
and essentially, as
the messages come in,

00:11:05.570 --> 00:11:08.270
we are putting
them into BigQuery.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.100
You have quite a
bit of flexibility

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:12.681
