about that last persona

00:27:29.800 --> 00:27:32.590
that we wanted to cover.

00:27:32.590 --> 00:27:34.090
KARTHI: Yeah.

00:27:34.090 --> 00:27:40.930
So essentially, this is the
persona that brings together

00:27:40.930 --> 00:27:42.550
the machine learning--

00:27:42.550 --> 00:27:44.590
sorry, the data scientist
with the machine

00:27:44.590 --> 00:27:46.660
learning models, as
