00:33:54.000 --> 00:33:56.490
So this is something
we can actually

00:33:56.490 --> 00:33:59.340
do because I've deployed the
model with Machine Learning

00:33:59.340 --> 00:34:01.260
Engine.

00:34:01.260 --> 00:34:06.076
And you can do it, actually,
directly from Datalab.

00:34:06.076 --> 00:34:08.159
That's one of the cool
things about using Datalab,

00:34:08.159 --> 00:34:11.544
